# Second Brain P3 / Lean Code Promotion Evaluation Report

**Campaign Status**: COMPLETED (14/14 Pairs, 28/28 Arms)
**Promotion Verdict**: `PROMOTE ACTIVE`
**Date**: 2026-08-16

---

## Executive Summary

The P3 Lean Code promotion evaluation benchmarked the Second Brain Lean Code kernel and progressive skill against 14 representative software tasks across two LLM provider families (DeepSeek v4 Flash and Gemini 3.7 Flash) using an isolated, counterbalanced paired-comparison design. Every arm was independently judged using deterministic acceptance oracles with anti-tamper verification.

- **Candidate Acceptance Rate**: 14/14 (100.0%) vs Baseline 14/14 (100.0%)
- **Code Surface Delta**: Candidate added 64 lines across 16 files vs Baseline 72 lines across 18 files (net 8 lines saved, 2 fewer files touched)
- **Token Economics**: Total candidate tokens: 1,761,070 vs baseline: 919,820
- **Anti-Laziness Compliance**: 100% — zero false-frugality omissions on legitimate tasks
- **P3-H STOP Compliance**: 100% — arms stopped immediately upon passing proof

